      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ISLE OF LACHLAN (8) was out of in the placings when fourth last time but three runs back produced a superb 27.48 win over 484m at this track. Can measure up again if runs up to recent best times. HERE'S RYDER (6) generally flies the lids but last time was always well back and ran below best, finishing seventh (24.45) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Was fast away and placed (24.45) at this track the start prior. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. EXTRA VOLTAGE (7) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at his last four runs. Last start finished 3rd in a NG on September 29 over 388m at Gosford behind On A Dime beaten 1.75 lengths (22.35). The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Must be included in calculations. KINGSBRAE EBANEE (2) cannot be underestimated.",
